      "text_chunk": "Climate Change and Its Global Impact Effects of Climate Change 1. Rising Temperatures: Global temperatures have increased significantly. 2. Melting Ice Caps: Leads to rising sea levels. 3. Extreme Weather: Increased frequency of hurricanes, droughts, and floods. 4. Ocean Acidification: Caused by excessive CO2 absorption. 5. Impact on Biodiversity: Loss of habitats and species extinction. Page 3",
