    {
      "text_chunk": "Climate Change and Its Global Impact Solutions to Combat Climate Change 1. Transition to Renewable Energy: Solar, wind, hydro, and geothermal. 2. Increase Energy Efficiency: Using less energy to perform the same task. 3. Afforestation: Planting trees to absorb CO2. 4. Sustainable Transportation: Electric vehicles and public transport. 5. Policy and Global Cooperation: International agreements and regulations. Page 4",
